; Run on the segments last first. First the ASP card of AX's row of the phoneme table; then five cards a segment
; in (pc, kind, and the TS, TE and ASP cards of row pc), six out: nxtpc (the next segment that isn't a pause), adjv
; (the segment after, if it is a vowel), nextv (the next vowel anywhere ahead, AX if none), ts and te (the
; segment's start and end filters) and nts (the start filter of the segment after; 0 for a pause). HH's filter is
; the aspirated form of the vowel after it (AX's if no vowel comes next): the ASP card of nxtpc's row, kept from
; when that segment went by.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            start   INP   axasp    03-03: AX's ASP
  04            rec     INP   pc       04-23: a segment; a pause: what lies ahead, and no filters
  05                    INP   kind
  06                    INP   ts
  07                    INP   te
  08                    INP   asp
  09                    CLA   kind
  10                    SUB   c8
  11                    TAC   sound
  12                    OUT   nxtpc
  13                    OUT   adjv
  14                    OUT   nextv
  15                    OUT   z
  16                    OUT   z
  17                    OUT   nts
  18                    CLA   z
  19                    STO   adjv
  20                    STO   nts
  21                    JMP   rec
  22            sound   CLA   kind     22-33: HH: the next vowel's ASP, or AX's
  23                    SUB   n7
  24                    TAC   emit
  25                    CLA   axasp
  26                    STO   ts
  27                    CLA   nxtv
  28                    SUB   00
  29                    TAC   hh
  30                    CLA   nasp
  31                    STO   ts
  32            hh      CLA   ts
  33                    STO   te
  34            emit    OUT   nxtpc    34-58: the cards, then this segment is the one ahead
  35                    OUT   adjv
  36                    OUT   nextv
  37                    OUT   ts
  38                    OUT   te
  39                    OUT   nts
  40                    CLA   pc
  41                    STO   nxtpc
  42                    CLA   ts
  43                    STO   nts
  44                    CLA   asp
  45                    STO   nasp
  46                    CLA   kind
  47                    SUB   n2
  48                    TAC   vw
  49                    CLA   z
  50                    STO   nxtv
  51                    STO   adjv
  52                    JMP   rec
  53            vw      CLA   00
  54                    STO   nxtv
  55                    CLA   pc
  56                    STO   adjv
  57                    STO   nextv
  58                    JMP   rec
  70            pc      DATA  0
  71            kind    DATA  0
  72            nasp    DATA  0
  73            ts      DATA  0
  74            te      DATA  0
  75            asp     DATA  0
  76            nxtpc   DATA  0
  77            nxtv    DATA  0
  78            adjv    DATA  0
  79            nextv   DATA  18       AX
  80            nts     DATA  0
  81            z       DATA  0
  82            c8      DATA  8
  83            n7      DATA  7
  84            n2      DATA  2
  85            axasp   DATA  0
